---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>DataDecision | Premium Data & AI Strategy Consulting</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Engineering decisions that matter. We transform complex data architectures and machine learning models into measurable business outcomes." />
    
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    
    <style>

        /* HERO (Direction 1: Split Proof) */
        .hero-split { background: #FAFAFA; padding: 160px 0 100px; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; }
        .hero-container { width: 100%; max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 40px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center; }
        .hero-headline { color: #0F172A; font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 5vw, 4.8rem); letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.05; margin-bottom: 24px; font-weight: 700; }
        .hero-subhead { color: #475569; font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 40px; max-width: 500px; }
        .btn-cobalt { background: #4338ca; color: white; padding: 16px 32px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; transition: background 0.2s; }
        .btn-cobalt:hover { background: #3730a3; color: white; }
        .btn-outline-dark { border: 1px solid #CBD5E1; color: #0F172A; padding: 16px 32px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; margin-left: 16px; transition: all 0.2s; }
        .btn-outline-dark:hover { background: #F1F5F9; }

        .proof-panel {
            background: #FAFAFA;
            border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
            border-radius: 4px;
            height: 420px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .chaos-layer {
            position: absolute; inset: 0; padding: 48px;
            color: #64748B;
            font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .resolved-layer {
            position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: #FAFAFA;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .scanner-line {
            position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 2px;
            background: #4338ca;
            box-shadow: 0 -4px 12px rgba(67, 56, 202, 0.4);
            display: none;
        }

        .flow-diagram { padding: 48px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; height: 100%; }
        .flow-step {
            position: relative; padding-left: 36px; color: #0F172A; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1rem;
        }
        .flow-step::before {
            content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);
            width: 12px; height: 12px; border: 2px solid #94A3B8; border-radius: 50%; background: #FAFAFA; z-index: 2;
        }
        .flow-step:not(:last-child)::after {
            content: ''; position: absolute; left: 5px; top: 24px;
            width: 2px; height: calc(100% + 24px); background: #E2E8F0; z-index: 1;
        }
        .flow-step.final-step { color: #4338ca; font-size: 1.25rem; }
        .flow-step.final-step::before { border-color: #4338ca; background: #4338ca; }

        /* ANIMATION LOGIC */
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
            .run-animation .resolved-layer {
                height: 0%;
                animation: scanDown 1.5s cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1) 0.8s forwards;
            }
            .run-animation .scanner-line {
                display: block;
                animation: fadeOutScanner 0.1s linear 2.3s forwards;
            }
            @keyframes scanDown { 0% { height: 0%; } 100% { height: 100%; } }
            @keyframes fadeOutScanner { to { opacity: 0; display: none; } }
        }

        @media(max-width: 1024px) {
            .hero-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; padding: 0 24px; }
            .hero-split { padding-top: 120px; }
            .hero-ctas { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
            .btn-outline-dark { margin-left: 0; text-align: center; justify-content: center; }
            .btn-cobalt { text-align: center; justify-content: center; }
        }

        :root {
            --bg-dark: #070709;
            --bg-darker: #040405;
            --bg-light: #ffffff;
            --bg-light-alt: #f8f9fa;
            
            --text-light: #ffffff;
            --text-muted: #a1a1aa;
            --text-dark: #0a0a0c;
            --text-dark-muted: #52525b;
            
            --accent: #0055FF;
            --accent-glow: rgba(0, 85, 255, 0.3);
            --accent-cyan: #00E5FF;
            
            --border-dark: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            --border-light: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            
            --font-sans: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
            --transition: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
        body { font-family: var(--font-sans); color: var(--text-dark); background: var(--bg-light); line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: hidden; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
        a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }
        ul { list-style: none; }
        img, video { max-width: 100%; display: block; }
        
        .container { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 5%; }
        .section { padding: 140px 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        
        /* Typography */
        h1, h2, h3, h4, h5 { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 1.1; }
        h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.5rem); letter-spacing: -0.05em; }
        h2 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); }
        h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
        .eyebrow { display: block; font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        
        /* Layouts & Backgrounds */
        .theme-dark { background: var(--bg-dark); color: var(--text-light); }
        .theme-darker { background: var(--bg-darker); color: var(--text-light); }
        .theme-light { background: var(--bg-light); color: var(--text-dark); }
        .theme-light-alt { background: var(--bg-light-alt); color: var(--text-dark); }

        /* Navigation */
        .navbar {
            position: fixed; top: 0; width: 100%; z-index: 1000;
            padding: 24px 0; transition: all 0.4s ease;
        }
        .navbar.scrolled { padding: 16px 0; background: rgba(7, 7, 9, 0.95); backdrop-filter: blur(16px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-dark); }
        .nav-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .logo-img { height: 26px; transition: all 0.3s ease; filter: brightness(0); } /* Black logo by default */
        .navbar.scrolled .logo-img { filter: invert(1); } /* White logo on scroll */
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 32px; align-items: center; }
        .nav-links a { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; color: #475569; transition: color 0.3s; }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: #0F172A; }
        .navbar.scrolled .nav-links a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }
        .navbar.scrolled .nav-links a:hover { color: #ffffff; }
        
        @media(max-width: 1024px) { .nav-links { display: none; } }

        /* Button */
        .btn {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            padding: 14px 28px; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 40px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.4s var(--transition);
        }
        .btn-primary { background: var(--accent); color: white; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px var(--accent-glow); border: 1px solid var(--accent); }
        .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 25px var(--accent-glow); }
        .btn-outline { background: transparent; color: inherit; border: 1px solid currentColor; opacity: 0.8; }
        .btn-outline:hover { opacity: 1; background: var(--text-light); color: var(--bg-dark); border-color: transparent; }
        .navbar.light-mode .btn-outline:hover { background: var(--text-dark); color: var(--bg-light); }

        /* Motion System */
        .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(40px); transition: opacity 1s var(--transition), transform 1s var(--transition), filter 1s var(--transition); filter: blur(8px); }
        .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); filter: blur(0); }
        .delay-1 { transition-delay: 0.1s; }
        .delay-2 { transition-delay: 0.2s; }
        .delay-3 { transition-delay: 0.3s; }

        /* Hero (Dark) */
        .hero { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; position: relative; padding-top: 100px; text-align: center; }
        .hero-video-wrapper {
            position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -2; overflow: hidden;
        }
        .hero-video-wrapper::after {
            content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(7,7,9,0.5), rgba(7,7,9,0.9));
        }
        #hero-video { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transform: scale(1.05); }
        
        .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .hero-title { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFFFF 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; }
        .hero-title em { font-family: 'Geist', serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: 500; color: var(--accent-cyan); -webkit-text-fill-color: var(--accent-cyan); }
        .hero p { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 2rem auto 3rem; max-width: 650px; }
        
        /* Particle Canvas */
        #particle-canvas { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; z-index: -1; opacity: 0.6; pointer-events: none; }

        /* Expertise Grid (Light) */
        
        .exp-card {
            min-width: 400px; max-width: 400px;
            background: var(--bg-light); border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            padding: 48px; border-radius: 2px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.5s var(--transition);
            cursor: default;
        }
        .exp-card::before {
            content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 2px;
            background: var(--accent); transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: left; transition: transform 0.5s var(--transition);
        }
        .exp-num { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-dark-muted); margin-bottom: 24px; display: block; font-family: monospace; }
        .exp-card h3 { color: var(--text-dark); margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 1.75rem; }
        .exp-desc { color: var(--text-dark-muted); font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 30px; transition: opacity 0.3s ease; }
        
        .exp-tech {
            display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);
            transition: all 0.5s var(--transition); position: absolute; bottom: 48px;
        }
        .exp-tech span { font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 4px 12px; background: rgba(0,85,255,0.08); color: var(--accent); border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 600; }
        
        .exp-card:hover { transform: translateY(-8px); box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
        .exp-card:hover::before { transform: scaleX(1); }
        .exp-card:hover .exp-desc { opacity: 0; }
        .exp-card:hover .exp-tech { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        @media(max-width: 768px) { .exp-card { min-width: 300px; max-width: 300px; } .exp-desc { opacity: 1 !important; } .exp-tech { position: relative; bottom: 0; opacity: 1; transform: none; margin-top: 20px; } }

        /* Technology Flow (Dark) */
        .tech-flow { position: relative; margin-top: 100px; padding: 80px 0; }
        .flow-nodes { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; position: relative; z-index: 2; }
        .node { width: 180px; text-align: center; }
        .node-circle {
            width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--bg-darker);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-dark); margin: 0 auto 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); position: relative; z-index: 3;
            transition: all 0.5s var(--transition);
        }
        .node:hover .node-circle { transform: scale(1.1); box-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--accent-glow); border-color: var(--accent); }
        .node h4 { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-light); }
        .node p { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 5px; }
        
        .flow-line { position: absolute; top: 40px; left: 10%; right: 10%; height: 1px; background: var(--border-dark); z-index: 1; }
        .flow-particle {
            position: absolute; top: -3px; left: 0; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent-cyan);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent-cyan);
            animation: flow 4s infinite cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }
        @keyframes flow { 0% { left: 0; opacity: 0; } 10% { opacity: 1; } 90% { opacity: 1; } 100% { left: 100%; opacity: 0; } }
        @media(max-width: 1024px) { .flow-nodes { flex-direction: column; gap: 40px; } .flow-line { display: none; } }

        /* Slider / Carousel System (Native Scroll) */
        .slider-container { margin-top: 60px; padding-bottom: 40px; }
        .slider-track { 
            display: flex; gap: 24px; 
            overflow-x: auto; 
            scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
            scrollbar-width: none; /* Firefox */
            -ms-overflow-style: none;  /* IE 10+ */
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
            /* Allow click and drag */
            cursor: grab;
        }
        .slider-track:active { cursor: grabbing; scroll-behavior: auto; }
        .slider-track::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; } /* Chrome/Safari */
        
        .slider-track > * { scroll-snap-align: start; flex-shrink: 0; }
        
        .slider-controls { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: 40px; }
        .slider-progress { flex: 1; height: 2px; background: var(--border-light); margin: 0 40px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .slider-progress-bar { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; height: 100%; width: 0%; background: var(--accent); transition: width 0.1s ease-out; }
        .slider-btn { background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--border-light); width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; color: var(--text-dark); }
        .theme-dark .slider-btn { border-color: var(--border-dark); color: var(--text-light); }
        .theme-dark .slider-progress { background: var(--border-dark); }
        .slider-btn:hover { background: var(--text-dark); color: var(--bg-light); }
        .theme-dark .slider-btn:hover { background: var(--text-light); color: var(--bg-dark); }

        /* Case Study Cards (Light) */
        .cs-card {
            min-width: 400px; max-width: 400px;
            display: flex; flex-direction: column;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            background: var(--bg-light); border-radius: 2px; overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.5s var(--transition);
        }
        .cs-img-wrap { height: 240px; overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
        .cs-img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 0.8s var(--transition); }
        .cs-card:hover .cs-img { transform: scale(1.05); }
        .cs-content { padding: 32px; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
        .cs-card h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .cs-card p { color: var(--text-dark-muted); margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 0.95rem; }
        .cs-cta { margin-top: auto; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; transition: gap 0.3s; }
        .cs-card:hover .cs-cta { gap: 12px; }
        .cs-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-color: rgba(0,85,255,0.3); }
        @media(max-width: 768px) { .cs-card { min-width: 300px; max-width: 300px; } }

        /* Insight Cards (Dark) */
        .ins-card {
            min-width: 320px; max-width: 320px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-dark);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 32px 24px; display: block;
            transition: all 0.4s var(--transition);
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }
        .ins-card::after {
            content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 0%; height: 2px;
            background: var(--accent); transition: width 0.4s var(--transition);
        }
        .ins-card:hover::after { width: 100%; }
        .ins-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }
        .ins-date { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 12px; display: block; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
        .ins-card h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--text-light); }

        /* Footer */
        .footer { padding: 80px 0 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-dark); }
        .footer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; margin-bottom: 80px; }
        .footer-links h4 { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-light); margin-bottom: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .footer-links ul li { margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .footer-links a { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; transition: color 0.2s; }
        .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
        .footer-bottom { padding-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-dark); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
        @media(max-width: 768px) { .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- NAVBAR -->
    <nav class="navbar" id="navbar">
        <div class="container nav-inner">
            <a href="/" class="logo">
                <img src="/datadecision-logo.png" alt="DataDecision" class="logo-img" />
            </a>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="#challenge">Who We Are</a>
                <a href="#expertise">Expertise</a>
                <a href="#case-studies">Work</a>
                <a href="#insights">Insights</a>
                <a href="#careers">Careers</a>
                <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline" style="padding: 8px 20px; margin-left: 20px;">Request a Brief</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero-split">
        <div class="hero-container">
            <div class="hero-left">
                <h1 class="hero-headline">Engineering decisions that matter.</h1>
                <p class="hero-subhead">We transform complex data architectures and machine learning models into measurable business outcomes.</p>
                <div class="hero-ctas">
                    <a href="#contact" class="btn-cobalt">Request a brief</a>
                    <a href="#case-studies" class="btn-outline-dark">Explore outcomes</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-right">
                <div class="proof-panel">
                    <div class="chaos-layer">
<pre><code>[STREAM_IN] 0x00A1F
sys.log.err: unmapped_schema
>> cluster_771 offline
WAITING...
[UNSTRUCTURED_POOL]
JOIN table_a, table_b ON (null)
val = NaN
01001100 01101111 01100111
>> END_STREAM</code></pre>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="resolved-layer">
                        <div class="scanner-line"></div>
                        <div class="flow-diagram">
                            <div class="flow-step">Business Problem</div>
                            <div class="flow-step">Data Architecture</div>
                            <div class="flow-step">ML Models</div>
                            <div class="flow-step">Intelligence</div>
                            <div class="flow-step final-step">Measurable Decision</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- EXPERTISE (Light) -->
    <section id="expertise" class="section theme-light">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="reveal">
                <span class="eyebrow">Capabilities</span>
                <h2>ENGINEERING ARSENAL.</h2>
            </div>
            
            <div class="slider-container reveal delay-1">
                <div class="slider-track" id="exp-track" style="gap: 24px;">
                    <div class="exp-card">
                        <span class="exp-num">01</span>
                        <h3>Data & Decision Intelligence</h3>
                        <p class="exp-desc">Translating raw mathematical outputs into board-level strategic roadmaps. Real-time dashboards, KPI tracking, and probabilistic modeling.</p>
                        <div class="exp-tech">
                            <span>Decision Systems</span>
                            <span>Forecasting</span>
                            <span>Optimization</span>
                            <span>Simulation</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="exp-card">
                        <span class="exp-num">02</span>
                        <h3>AI / ML Engineering</h3>
                        <p class="exp-desc">Production-grade predictive models and Generative AI workflows designed to automate complex decision-making and reduce operational overhead.</p>
                        <div class="exp-tech">
                            <span>Machine Learning</span>
                            <span>Deep Learning</span>
                            <span>NLP</span>
                            <span>Computer Vision</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="exp-card">
                        <span class="exp-num">03</span>
                        <h3>Data Engineering & Infrastructure</h3>
                        <p class="exp-desc">Scalable, fault-tolerant data pipelines and warehouse modernization. We transform messy, siloed data into highly structured intelligence.</p>
                        <div class="exp-tech">
                            <span>Data Platforms</span>
                            <span>Cloud Architecture</span>
                            <span>MLOps</span>
                            <span>Data Products</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="exp-card">
                        <span class="exp-num">04</span>
                        <h3>Intelligent Operations</h3>
                        <p class="exp-desc">Direct partnership with leadership to align technical AI capabilities with aggressive business growth, security, and acquisition targets.</p>
                        <div class="exp-tech">
                            <span>Demand Forecasting</span>
                            <span>Supply Chain</span>
                            <span>Pricing</span>
                            <span>Customer Analytics</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="slider-controls">
                    <button class="slider-btn prev-btn" aria-label="Previous">&larr;</button>
                    <div class="slider-progress"><div class="slider-progress-bar" id="exp-progress"></div></div>
                    <button class="slider-btn next-btn" aria-label="Next">&rarr;</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TECHNOLOGY ARCHITECTURE (Dark) -->
    <section id="challenge" class="section theme-darker">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="reveal">
                <span class="eyebrow">Intelligence Architecture</span>
                <h2>DIFFERENT PROBLEMS.<br>DIFFERENT INTELLIGENCE.</h2>
                <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.15rem; max-width: 600px; margin-top: 1.5rem;">From predictive models to decision systems, we assemble the right combination of data, algorithms, engineering, and domain expertise for the problem at hand.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="tech-flow reveal delay-2">
                <div class="flow-line"><div class="flow-particle"></div></div>
